    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes and villains from 13+ Indie JRPGs collide in this story rich Crossover Event! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring characters from Chained Echoes, Quartet, Jack Move, 8-Bit Adventures 2, Beloved Rapture, and many more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pulled from their homes and stranded on a dead world, a disparate group of champions must face their past, redeem a failed hero, and slay a dark force which threatens all creation... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in stylish turn-based battles with a party of 9 unique heroes, and encounter familiar friends, foes, and environments re-imagined. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Alliance</strong> showcases the creative variety of the Indie JRPG scene, and we hope you'll discover your next favorite game through this epic FREE adventure!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720330/extras/da02efbfabc6d35d01d4069c67c9750d.avif?t=1748564436\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glenn from <strong>Chained Echoes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Warrior (named by the player) from <strong>8-Bit Adventures 2</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noa from <strong>Jack Move</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whoopis from <strong>My Familiar</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vera and Arin from <strong>Eternal Remnant</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alexandra from <strong>Quartet</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rio from <strong>Shrine\u2019s Legacy</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dustin from <strong>Kingdoms of the Dump</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chel from <strong>For a Vast Future\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gio from <strong>Geo Mythica</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Villains</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drago from <strong>Beloved Rapture</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Montam from <strong>Venaitura</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fateshifter from <strong>Ephemeral Tale</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Qliphoth - an original villain.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And more to be announced...</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes and villains from 13+ Indie JRPGs collide in this story rich Crossover Event! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring characters from Chained Echoes, Quartet, Jack Move, 8-Bit Adventures 2, Beloved Rapture, and many more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pulled from their homes and stranded on a dead world, a disparate group of champions must face their past, redeem a failed hero, and slay a dark force which threatens all creation... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in stylish turn-based battles with a party of 9 unique heroes, and encounter familiar friends, foes, and environments re-imagined. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Alliance</strong> showcases the creative variety of the Indie JRPG scene, and we hope you'll discover your next favorite game through this epic FREE adventure!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720330/extras/da02efbfabc6d35d01d4069c67c9750d.avif?t=1748564436\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glenn from <strong>Chained Echoes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Warrior (named by the player) from <strong>8-Bit Adventures 2</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noa from <strong>Jack Move</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whoopis from <strong>My Familiar</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vera and Arin from <strong>Eternal Remnant</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alexandra from <strong>Quartet</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rio from <strong>Shrine\u2019s Legacy</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dustin from <strong>Kingdoms of the Dump</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chel from <strong>For a Vast Future\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gio from <strong>Geo Mythica</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Villains</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drago from <strong>Beloved Rapture</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Montam from <strong>Venaitura</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fateshifter from <strong>Ephemeral Tale</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Qliphoth - an original villain.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And more to be announced...</i></p>",
